    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Your Side Girls&quot; is an idle computer desktop game where you spend time together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is watching what you are doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation instructions: It will follow the mouse. It supports dragging to move and zooming in and out. It will respond if you stroke its head. It will also move randomly from time to time to react. It also supports dual screens. Multiple simultaneous displays are possible.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Your Side Girls&quot; is an idle computer desktop game where you spend time together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is watching what you are doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation instructions: It will follow the mouse. It supports dragging to move and zooming in and out. It will respond if you stroke its head. It will also move randomly from time to time to react. It also supports dual screens. Multiple simultaneous displays are possible.</p>",
    "short_description": "She'll be by your side while you work or study. She'll be watching what you're doing. Whether you're relaxing or busy with work. Try spending some of your time with her! She doesn't have a purpose. But she's always there.",
